WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.463
And the Graph facts.

2
00:00:01.463 --> 00:00:06.093
User dot Read dot All is the
least-privileged application permission both

3
00:00:06.093 --> 00:00:10.575
to list users and to read one, and the
audit needs AuditLog dot Read dot All.

4
00:00:10.575 --> 00:00:15.284
One wrinkle: application permissions
aren't supported on the manager endpoint,

5
00:00:15.284 --> 00:00:19.350
and Learn documents expanding the
manager on the users list instead.

6
00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:24.350
Microsoft 365 GCC uses
the worldwide Graph host.

7
00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:28.180
SailPoint's Identity Security
Cloud is FedRAMP Moderate.
